<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-20T03:38:28.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:38:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have seized a major town in eastern DRC, breaking a ceasefire and intensifying fighting with the Congolese army, while ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province. A drone strike hit Bunyakiri hospital, forcing MSF to move 76 patients, and Rwanda’s foreign minister says the US has an unbalanced approach to the DR Congo deal as the US imposes sanctions on Rwanda for alleged support to rebels. Direct Relief delivered 53 tons of medical aid to combat the record Ebola outbreak, and the FRN-M23 rebels announced a plan to build 3,300 houses to ease the Goma housing crisis. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/19/uk-eu-talks-asylum-seekers-third-country-hubs&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/t%C3%AAte-%C3%A0-t%C3%AAte/20261119-us-has-unbalanced-approach-on-dr-congo-deal-rwanda-s-foreign-minister-says&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNM0pnNDhHc0djU1FuRTROYW1nSEtfWGRaRTJUZ1VYUkFfQzJuMUJtZzZ0NnJtUklKX2F6eUtPOXNBY1NQalNoTjRkd2Z5VGRhWUdPTHZjM01yMVkyMDNVTEk4ZmhEaG94aV9qWUtNdXowNHJ4Rk1TN0kyN2ZzSGJCUWlrb1BWcDFMa0FESWRuYkJLS2xwcHJwUWZNVTlrNXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;KT PRESS -&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQVnlVbXREM09HdnNsUmdxM3dlRVZ6OGNmajRqX2NickpJODctYlhLdXZmMlBOVVJlNU5zT1hNMUo1dHpkZ0tJT3pjODQwQy1LUG5HX2hoOXlYdmY0M1ExM2ZMSER1MFlwUU1HQTBRdjdlSnB4TlhhNUE5aTFVOXJLb2Nja1gzbElxUDBtT2VIbERxQnFTakIyZ1pjdFZpcnhzMEtLVmtidVBBSzJCNEt